                        </div>
                        <small class="text-muted">Wash + Dry + Fold is the package with the customer's own supplies; this is added per load when the shop's are used.</small>
                    </div>
                </div>
                
                <div class="mt-5 border-top pt-4 text-end">
                    <button type="submit" class="btn btn-ezk px-5 py-2 shadow-sm"><i class="bi bi-save me-2"></i> Save Pricing Changes</button>
